<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Last Human Message</title>

<style>

body{
margin:0;
padding:0;
font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
background:#5b0000;
color:#ffffff;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
min-height:100vh;
}

.container{
width:90%;
max-width:700px;
text-align:center;
}

h1{
font-size:48px;
font-weight:900;
margin-bottom:20px;
}

h2{
font-size:28px;
margin-bottom:30px;
}

p{
font-size:20px;
line-height:1.8;
}

.card{
background:#770000;
padding:35px;
border-radius:20px;
margin-top:35px;
}

button{
margin-top:25px;
padding:18px 40px;
font-size:22px;
font-weight:bold;
border:none;
border-radius:40px;
background:white;
color:#770000;
cursor:pointer;
}

button:hover{
opacity:0.9;
}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<h1>LAST HUMAN MESSAGE</h1>

<h2>A stranger left a message for you.</h2>

<p>
You don't know who they are.<br>
You don't know what they wrote.<br>
Maybe it's a secret.<br>
Maybe it's a life experience.<br>
Maybe it will change your day.
</p>

<div class="card">

<h2>$2</h2>

<p>
Unlock the last message.<br><br>

Then leave your own message<br>
for the next person.
</p>

<button>
REVEAL THE MESSAGE
</button>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
